    "show_share": true,
    "description": "AKU Trustee Dr Elizabeth Cannon, the former President of the University of Calgary, was awarded with the Alberta Order of Excellence by Lieutenant Governor Salma Lakhani in Edmonton, Canada on October 20. The award is the highest recognition the province bestows on its citizens.",
